# Mission Creation

Purpose

Create editable mission definitions.

Allowed

* Create missions
* Edit mission metadata
* Import imagery
* Import GIS data
* Save drafts
* Load drafts
* Delete drafts

Forbidden

* Generate routes
* Generate coverage
* Select drones automatically
* Allocate resources
* Compute schedules
* Execute missions
* Modify Digital Twin runtime

Produces

Mission Definition

Consumes

Operator input

