# Replay

Purpose

Historical visualization.

Allowed

* Playback
* Timeline
* Scrubbing
* Historical reconstruction

Forbidden

* Modify history
* Resume missions
* Change runtime state

Replay is permanently read-only.

---

# Analytics

Purpose

Operational insight.

Allowed

Display backend metrics.

Forbidden

* Create synthetic metrics
* Predict outcomes
* Modify operational state

Analytics never generates business logic.

---

